{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0\u201cThe asylum was abandoned. The horrors were not.\u201d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Providence</strong> is a psychological horror exploration game set in the ruins of a long-forgotten asylum. You play as Finley \u201cFinn\u201d Clarke, an urban explorer drawn into a place where reality bends, memories twist, and something unnatural lingers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a shifting world where every shadow tells a story. Solve layered puzzles, interact with objects in immersive ways, and uncover secrets buried deep within the asylum\u2019s walls.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >World Interaction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manipulate your environment in tactile, physical ways. Doors, drawers, and devices aren\u2019t just props\u2014they\u2019re part of the mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/1362b33adb1ff23474e958f8154badec.poster.avif?t=1760235447\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/1362b33adb1ff23474e958f8154badec.webm?t=1760235447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/1362b33adb1ff23474e958f8154badec.mp4?t=1760235447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reactive Environment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The asylum changes as you play. Rooms shift, paths appear or disappear, and familiar places warp based on your actions. The world responds to you\u2014sometimes subtly, sometimes not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/3f598fd87328be71ba2f6b74b42f7324.poster.avif?t=1760235447\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/3f598fd87328be71ba2f6b74b42f7324.webm?t=1760235447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/3f598fd87328be71ba2f6b74b42f7324.mp4?t=1760235447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Item Discovery</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search, collect, and use key items to unlock deeper paths\u2014and deeper truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/5c03eeb1760da4fc411b0d90f3372d3c.poster.avif?t=1760235447\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/5c03eeb1760da4fc411b0d90f3372d3c.webm?t=1760235447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/5c03eeb1760da4fc411b0d90f3372d3c.mp4?t=1760235447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Environmental Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through atmospheric, logic-driven challenges that reveal fragments of the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/122bede4da7f19274fa70093aa3fdc08.poster.avif?t=1760235447\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/122bede4da7f19274fa70093aa3fdc08.webm?t=1760235447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/122bede4da7f19274fa70093aa3fdc08.mp4?t=1760235447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive Environments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a variety of richly detailed spaces, from decaying hospital wards to overgrown courtyards and sealed-off research wings. Every area is hand-crafted to tell a story through atmosphere, sound, and environmental detail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/23cdd3468e199ef6fe1913c9feb2c611.poster.avif?t=1760235447\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/23cdd3468e199ef6fe1913c9feb2c611.webm?t=1760235447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/23cdd3468e199ef6fe1913c9feb2c611.mp4?t=1760235447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only contact is Claire, a voice on the walkie-talkie. Sometimes she answers. Sometimes\u2026 something else does.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The asylum is watching. Will you uncover its truth\u2014or be consumed by it?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3643600?t=1760235447","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3643600?t=1760235447","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/a053a978aadbc06e52a9b4bdbce1ba644d4e279f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760235447","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/a053a978aadbc06e52a9b4bdbce1ba644d4e279f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760235447","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Mild horror and suspense, reference to murder and torture."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0\u201cThe asylum was abandoned. The horrors were not.\u201d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Providence</strong> is a psychological horror exploration game set in the ruins of a long-forgotten asylum. You play as Finley \u201cFinn\u201d Clarke, an urban explorer drawn into a place where reality bends, memories twist, and something unnatural lingers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a shifting world where every shadow tells a story. Solve layered puzzles, interact with objects in immersive ways, and uncover secrets buried deep within the asylum\u2019s walls.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >World Interaction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manipulate your environment in tactile, physical ways. Doors, drawers, and devices aren\u2019t just props\u2014they\u2019re part of the mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/1362b33adb1ff23474e958f8154badec.poster.avif?t=1760235447\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/1362b33adb1ff23474e958f8154badec.webm?t=1760235447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/1362b33adb1ff23474e958f8154badec.mp4?t=1760235447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reactive Environment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The asylum changes as you play. Rooms shift, paths appear or disappear, and familiar places warp based on your actions. The world responds to you\u2014sometimes subtly, sometimes not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/3f598fd87328be71ba2f6b74b42f7324.poster.avif?t=1760235447\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/3f598fd87328be71ba2f6b74b42f7324.webm?t=1760235447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/3f598fd87328be71ba2f6b74b42f7324.mp4?t=1760235447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Item Discovery</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search, collect, and use key items to unlock deeper paths\u2014and deeper truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/5c03eeb1760da4fc411b0d90f3372d3c.poster.avif?t=1760235447\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/5c03eeb1760da4fc411b0d90f3372d3c.webm?t=1760235447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/5c03eeb1760da4fc411b0d90f3372d3c.mp4?t=1760235447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Environmental Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through atmospheric, logic-driven challenges that reveal fragments of the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/122bede4da7f19274fa70093aa3fdc08.poster.avif?t=1760235447\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/122bede4da7f19274fa70093aa3fdc08.webm?t=1760235447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/122bede4da7f19274fa70093aa3fdc08.mp4?t=1760235447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive Environments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a variety of richly detailed spaces, from decaying hospital wards to overgrown courtyards and sealed-off research wings. Every area is hand-crafted to tell a story through atmosphere, sound, and environmental detail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/23cdd3468e199ef6fe1913c9feb2c611.poster.avif?t=1760235447\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/23cdd3468e199ef6fe1913c9feb2c611.webm?t=1760235447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/extras/23cdd3468e199ef6fe1913c9feb2c611.mp4?t=1760235447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only contact is Claire, a voice on the walkie-talkie. Sometimes she answers. Sometimes\u2026 something else does.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The asylum is watching. Will you uncover its truth\u2014or be consumed by it?</p>","developers":["ZombieForge Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643600/e898b8c6f7c7ff18dcfe0a85905d7eb4c70aa8b6/header.jpg?t=1760235447","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3643600/1899145253/4925ff1bf097dbb946859e72bc369cf837204f4a/176020351